a": "896da4bf2576c7cab9cb29c1069cc2d14bb33da0", "message": "Ultimate Shader and 4K HDRi\n\nAdded the third shared (Ultimate) with more features. Currently, Sharpening, Blur, and Vignette are implemented.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T16:56:58Z", "repo": "Godot-4-Color-Correction-and-Screen-Effects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}